Subject: [PATCH] mediatek: gl-mt3600be: disable broken RTL8221B EEE

Disable 100BASE-TX and 1000BASE-T EEE advertisement on the external
RTL8221B PHY to work around packet loss and slow Ethernet transmission
on OpenWrt 25.12. Adapted from the GL-MT3600BE change in PR #25996;
this is a board-specific workaround, not a PHY driver fix.

Source: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/25996
Issue: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/issues/20967

--- a/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7987a-glinet-gl-mt3600be.dts
+++ b/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7987a-glinet-gl-mt3600be.dts
@@ -118,6 +118,8 @@
 		reset-assert-us = <100000>;
 		reset-deassert-us = <100000>;
 		reset-gpios = <&pio 42 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+		eee-broken-100tx;
+		eee-broken-1000t;
 	};
 
 	phy15: phy@f {
